      "content": "Here's the revised draft:\n\n\"We're aware of a widespread technical issue affecting our database overnight, which has resulted in some customer data being temporarily surfaced without proper affiliation. We immediately shut down the affected systems and launched a comprehensive investigation to identify the root cause. We have confirmed that no sensitive customer information was compromised during this glitch, and our robust security protocols remain intact to protect our customers' sensitive data. We're taking immediate action to prevent any future incidents and appreciate the understanding and trust of our valued customers.\"",
