      "content": "Here's another revised draft:\n\n\"We're aware of a technical issue affecting our database overnight, which has resulted in some customer data being inadvertently exposed. We immediately took corrective action to prevent any further unauthorized access and launched a thorough investigation into the cause. We have confirmed that no sensitive customer information, including names, email addresses, social security numbers, or financial data, was accessed or compromised during this glitch. We're taking immediate action to implement enhanced security measures and appreciate the understanding and trust of our valued customers.\"",
